this was the golden age of small

163
00:06:02,521 --> 00:06:03,063
trucks.

164
00:06:03,243 --> 00:06:05,300
Ford, Chevy, GMC,

165
00:06:05,300 --> 00:06:07,962
Dodge, Toyota, Nissan,

166
00:06:07,962 --> 00:06:12,802
Mazda and Isuzu all sold compact pickups

167
00:06:12,802 --> 00:06:14,133
in America.

168
00:06:14,313 --> 00:06:16,731
A buyer could choose a basic work

169
00:06:16,731 --> 00:06:18,783
truck for very little money,

