224
00:08:15,809 --> 00:08:18,669
Every buyer who chose a Ranger instead

225
00:08:18,669 --> 00:08:21,302
of an F-one-fifty was money left on

226
00:08:21,302 --> 00:08:22,055
the table.

227
00:08:22,235 --> 00:08:25,295
And with fuel economy improving in full-size

228
00:08:25,295 --> 00:08:27,937
