230
00:08:29,052 --> 00:08:30,996
But here is the bigger twist,

231
00:08:30,996 --> 00:08:32,941
the rule almost nobody knows.

232
00:08:33,121 --> 00:08:34,630
According to Hagerty,

233
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:38,007
