241
00:08:57,272 --> 00:08:59,285
Here is how it worked in simple

242
00:08:59,285 --> 00:08:59,675
terms.

243
00:08:59,855 --> 00:09:01,912
Under the footprint formula,

244
00:09:01,912 --> 00:09:04,778
each vehicle gets a fuel economy target

245
00:09:04,778 --> 00:09:06,101
