248
00:09:11,674 --> 00:09:14,083
If a carmaker builds a small truck

249
00:09:14,083 --> 00:09:16,988
that is only slightly more efficient than

250
00:09:16,988 --> 00:09:17,980
its big truck,

251
00:09:17,980 --> 00:09:20,602
the small truck can actually make its

252
00:09:20,602 --> 00:09:21,949
